  "title": "Metamako: Metamako dissector update",
  "description": "The Metamako trailer has changed a lot over the years, this commit reflects these changes.\nCurrent dissector result:\n```\nMetamako ethernet trailer, Timestamp: 11:39:30.878524220, Source Device: 61695, Source Port: 46\n    Original FCS: 0x0d931a08\n    Trailer Extensions, Sub-nanoseconds: 0.109375000ns\n        Unknown Tag [0x00002]: cbd52437856874d2000000\n        Unknown Tag [0x00003]: 00007d\n        Sub-nanoseconds: 0.109375000ns\n    Time Stamp: Oct 17, 2022 11:39:30.878524220 AEDT\n        [Time Difference: -0.211266780 seconds]\n    Flags: 0x26, Has Trailer Extensions\n        .... ...0 = Original FCS Valid: Invalid\n        .... ..1. = Has Trailer Extensions: True\n        0010 01.. = Reserved: 0x09\n    Source Device ID: 61695\n    Source Port: 46\n```\n\nUpdated dissector result:\n```\nMetamako ethernet trailer, Timestamp: 11:39:30.878524220, Source Device: 61695, Source Port: 46\n    Original FCS: 0x0d931a08\n    Trailer Extensions, CRC64 Hash: 0xcbd52437856874d2, Egress Sequence No: 125, Sub-nanoseconds: 0.109375000ns\n        CRC64 Hash: 0xcbd52437856874d2\n        Egress Sequence Number: 125\n        Sub-nanoseconds: 0.109375000ns\n    Time Stamp: Oct 17, 2022 11:39:30.878524220 AEDT\n        [Time Difference: -0.211266780 seconds]\n    Flags: 0x26, Clause 49 BTF, Duplicate Packet, Has Trailer Extensions\n        00.. 0... = Reserved: 0x00\n        ..1. .... = Clause 49 BTF: 0x78\n        ...0 .... = Timestamp degraded: False\n        .... .1.. = Duplicate Packet: True\n        .... ..1. = Has Trailer Extensions: True\n        .... ...0 = Original FCS Valid: Invalid\n    Source Device ID: 61695\n    Source Port: 46\n```",
